    {
      "id": "chunk-50df28a0b01f219bc6d8a52fc227814c73da98469a23838fe9c50d66e758e4fd",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 10,
        "sha256": "sha256:1becbc87f0a2ad16e7bc7cd4d92343bacdc1f4bc7c2eb4674cc1ce33ca434860",
        "source_id": "source-36277c70704daf757a36cf1cee2546aeabfd1ca59c2f1a9085ae277f62640958",
        "start_line": 1,
        "text": "# 构造评价材料\n\ntrain、calibration、development、test 四种角色独立初始化。前缀暖机，不计分。\n校准只用 calibration 无标签分数，选择只用 development；冻结后只测试胜出候选一次。\n最终测试不得用于代码修复、调参或换选候选；没有业务门槛只能报告实测。\n默认连续两点超阈值，从第二点告警，不向前补记；非超阈值或不可判断重置计数。\n点对应半开时间单元，连续告警合并事件，trigger 必须落在真实事件内，一对一匹配。\n正类弃权计 FN，正常弃权另列，不计 TN；覆盖率包含全部计分点。\nPrecision 无预测时为空，Recall 无真实异常时为空；禁止 point adjustment。\n方法语义检查、效果测量、业务达标分别报告。效果标签来自独立模拟注入，不由检测器决定。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-5f6d54b720e14dc69ad159dbbb9a31707ff8866d7940364ced1b76704e4af189",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 64,
        "sha256": "sha256:72444d9aa3d816a119b23a394640a897cf13f030b5ce5010ea2724fa5840e31e",
        "source_id": "source-0171abfd70df5882656c9ab08fa844aa9bf67787cb99e22c619c3f8718217281",
        "start_line": 33,
        "text": "        self.history = []\n\n    def score_one(self, point):\n        if self.floor is None:\n            raise ValueError(\"fit required\")\n        value, evidence = point[\"value\"], {}\n        score, status = None, \"ok\"\n        if value is None:\n            status = \"missing_input\"\n        elif sum(slot[1] for slot in self.history) < self.config[\"min_history\"]:\n            status = \"insufficient_history\"\n        else:\n            values = [slot[0] for slot in self.history if slot[0] is not None]\n            center = median(values)\n            mad = median([abs(x - center) for x in values])\n            scale = max(1.4826 * mad, self.floor)\n            delta = value - center\n            if self.config[\"direction\"] == \"lower\":\n                delta = -delta\n            elif self.config[\"direction\"] == \"two_sided\":\n                delta = abs(delta)\n            score = delta / scale\n            evidence = {\"median\": center, \"mad\": mad, \"scale\": scale}\n        self.history.append([value, point[\"original_present\"]])\n        self.history = self.history[-self.config[\"window\"]:]\n        return {\"timestamp\": point[\"timestamp\"], \"host_id\": point[\"host_id\"],\n                \"status\": status, \"score\": score, \"evidence\": evidence}\n\n    def save_state(self):\n        return json.dumps({\"config\": self.config, \"floor\": self.floor, \"history\": self.history}, allow_nan=False)\n\n    def load_state(self, raw):"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-66019de7847be2b28236aa130789b8240731ce317b8b0a4af664a7be97700726",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 8,
        "sha256": "sha256:b2cceceb866b5eda5662b41cb0bffe117e408bd8a0fa447edbb802672f690618",
        "source_id": "source-97a77ad30f7a0b8cffe235cf0e976b80038afc54b52f87f2ae18117ce4506b0d",
        "start_line": 1,
        "text": "# 构造业务材料：正常高峰与异常\n\n单主机 CPU、内存、磁盘延迟、网络速率可出现正常业务高峰，与异常数值区间重叠。\nfixed_threshold 和 rolling_mad 都不能仅靠该数值判定故障根因。\nMAD 适合检测相对历史偏离，固定阈值适合已有清晰绝对上/下界的需求。\n周期波动、缓慢漂移、长期缺失是必须保留的困难样本，不能从评价分母删除。\n历史实现即使工程通过，也必须在新输入上重新验证；失败实现只能作为风险经验。\n本材料只支持 gauge/rate、单主机单指标，不支持日志语义、Isolation Forest 或季节模型。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-6ea94804be639006f4a4e9a76956bcefea95398a78279e19ab1de5361f32d779",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 39,
        "sha256": "sha256:da48f788bf72108e88804dd30653278f80a87ab2514723c2246936a9f4810bdd",
        "source_id": "source-74b5788c8efcc29ca5dcbbf4b608c0d755fb6b5a7cee57c53850b53fa5041193",
        "start_line": 33,
        "text": "    def load_state(self, raw):\n        if json.loads(raw) != {\"config\": self.config}:\n            raise ValueError(\"state config mismatch\")\n\n\ndef create_detector(config):\n    return Detector(config)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-6f7901a37608c1205d444bc404b8098d89e1617f0d1633c73d1c22e0e05ba7ac",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 11,
        "sha256": "sha256:4d21e32573560e325bfff9bbb5528c607f1017660f11f9fac911448d0812b09a",
        "source_id": "source-9b329ea3663d980d9ae702252a5e380b40f9d2efc3801882d1b9019744038bd3",
        "start_line": 1,
        "text": "# 构造专家材料：rolling_mad\n\n适用于单主机单指标 gauge/rate，依赖 metrics-py312-stdlib/1。\nW 默认 30 个时间槽，min_history 默认 15 个真实观测，且 min_history<=W。\n仅用当前点之前最近 W 个槽；统计可用观测含短缺失插补值，但插补不增加真实历史数。\nm=历史中位数，MAD=|历史-m| 的中位数，scale=max(1.4826*MAD, scale_floor)。\n训练原始有效值的 R7 IQR 决定 scale_floor=max(1e-9,IQR*1e-6)。\nupper=(x-m)/scale，lower=(m-x)/scale，two_sided=|x-m|/scale。\n先评分再追加当前点；不可用点也占历史时间槽，历史不足返回 insufficient_history 和空分数。\ncalibration 的可判断计分分数至少 100 个，nearest-rank 0.99 分位阈值；不使用标签。\n严格 score>阈值，所有可用点（含异常）均更新窗口，长漂移可能被吸收，周期模式可能误报。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-71056a6f0eba69735041caa3ef8483a2e0f86a9215287c361fa8a6c41de5ba21",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 32,
        "sha256": "sha256:dddb3df36bd4a17ed7fd89c1245403cc345ada9618a4ca571eeafb4c91a0ae48",
        "source_id": "source-0171abfd70df5882656c9ab08fa844aa9bf67787cb99e22c619c3f8718217281",
        "start_line": 1,
        "text": "\"\"\"Constructed human reference (origin=reference), not generated model code.\n\nUse previous W time slots. Only original observations count for min_history;\nforward-filled values may affect median/MAD. Update history AFTER scoring.\nThe training R7 IQR sets the numerical floor; no labels are used.\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nfrom statistics import median\n\n\ndef quantile(values, q):\n    values = sorted(values)\n    pos = (len(values) - 1) * q\n    lo = int(pos)\n    hi = min(lo + 1, len(values) - 1)\n    return values[lo] + (values[hi] - values[lo]) * (pos - lo)\n\n\nclass Detector:\n    def __init__(self, config):\n        self.config = dict(config)\n        self.floor = None\n        self.history = []\n\n    def fit(self, train_points):\n        values = [p[\"value\"] for p in train_points if p[\"value\"] is not None]\n        if not values:\n            raise ValueError(\"no valid training observations\")\n        self.floor = max(1e-9, (quantile(values, 0.75) - quantile(values, 0.25)) * 1e-6)\n        self.reset()\n\n    def reset(self):"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-9fdc4618934c65208b705044487750899a698cf00f1e25e52554832504313804",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 32,
        "sha256": "sha256:981904a2f34cebbf0f3a970ea60e576e2c34c653ac71801cef777d6b2c28f218",
        "source_id": "source-74b5788c8efcc29ca5dcbbf4b608c0d755fb6b5a7cee57c53850b53fa5041193",
        "start_line": 1,
        "text": "\"\"\"Constructed human reference (origin=reference), never an LLM-generated result.\n\nUpper score=x-T, lower score=T-x. Equality is not an alert. The trusted driver\nowns preprocessing, persistence and labels; the detector only emits scores.\n\"\"\"\nimport json\n\n\nclass Detector:\n    def __init__(self, config):\n        self.config = dict(config)\n\n    def fit(self, train_points):\n        if not any(point[\"value\"] is not None for point in train_points):\n            raise ValueError(\"no valid training observations\")\n        self.reset()\n\n    def reset(self):\n        pass\n\n    def score_one(self, point):\n        value = point[\"value\"]\n        delta = None if value is None else value - self.config[\"threshold\"]\n        if delta is not None and self.config[\"direction\"] == \"lower\":\n            delta = -delta\n        return {\"timestamp\": point[\"timestamp\"], \"host_id\": point[\"host_id\"],\n                \"status\": \"missing_input\" if value is None else \"ok\", \"score\": delta,\n                \"evidence\": {\"threshold\": self.config[\"threshold\"]}}\n\n    def save_state(self):\n        return json.dumps({\"config\": self.config}, allow_nan=False)\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-a2ff1b5a07f2f1603e5f212d49f5d60b7f21b9df5a5bcb891ecaef90586a07a4",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 8,
        "sha256": "sha256:6215d6ee955e2f0144f85b7c6858dead4a04f7702c1d415412e8ea136d901a1b",
        "source_id": "source-8aa09fc385453bbbccd68b26e083b14040147c7d4c48028ce969f50cd7c0ae01",
        "start_line": 1,
        "text": "# 构造专家材料：fixed_threshold\n\n适用于单主机单指标 gauge/rate，依赖 metrics-py312-stdlib/1，不需要历史基线。\nupper 分数为 x-T，lower 分数为 T-x。严格 score>0 才是异常候选；等号不触发。\n业务阈值必须来自用户明确值或有引用的业务材料；假设阈值要标为 candidate_assumption。\n本材料没有给定任何指标的业务阈值；禁止虚构业务达标保证。\ncalibration 不改变固定阈值 T；共享可信告警器处理连续点数和事件合并。\n绝对阈值可能漏掉低基线主机的相对变化，也可能对正常业务高峰误报。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-a9459372dddbdfa7919ab0daae5ff3f659da54554b798f78e620df858b558742",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 9,
        "sha256": "sha256:9fe4a4a687ecaa772af8d6f9eb202a1cdc5234dbb2eb1d4377c392a1b2c1194e",
        "source_id": "source-cf538ad1148ef947276baa133928fc6fa78fcdabd3a6206c7718b8b1fbddd646",
        "start_line": 1,
        "text": "# 构造材料：单主机指标字段规范\n\n本文件是模拟业务专家材料，不是生产经验。\n输入为单主机、单指标，字段 timestamp、host_id、value；时间为 UTC，固定采样间隔。\nmetric_kind 仅允许 gauge 或已换算的 rate，原始 counter 不支持。\nCPU、内存以 percent 为单位，磁盘延迟以 ms 为单位，网络速率以 bytes/s 为单位。\n缺少 value 保留时间槽，不能删除行。重复、乱序、无穷值和物理范围外值拒绝。\n向前填充最多三点，无历史或超过三点时 missing_input；不能把缺失当正常。\n两种算法都支持 gauge/rate，不执行根因定位或多主机联合检测。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chunk-d8caad78b7a2aadb19b9dc03a9c71319f15076d3b7f3d5c668ba22c932bc9487",
      "kind": "Chunk",
      "payload": {
        "end_line": 72,
        "sha256": "sha256:d471cc29f307f234335c5cd50c28ba3cf3e9edb392e7ce5b644a80155e314855",
        "source_id": "source-0171abfd70df5882656c9ab08fa844aa9bf67787cb99e22c619c3f8718217281",
        "start_line": 65,
        "text": "        state = json.loads(raw)\n        if state[\"config\"] != self.config or len(state[\"history\"]) > self.config[\"window\"]:\n            raise ValueError(\"state config/history mismatch\")\n        self.floor, self.history = state[\"floor\"], state[\"history\"]\n\n\ndef create_detector(config):\n    return Detector(config)"
      }
    },
